{"id":55165,"date":"2026-07-28T08:41:40","date_gmt":"2026-07-28T07:41:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=55165"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:46:02","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:46:02","slug":"trail-dolorosa-de-moldes","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-dolorosa-de-moldes\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Dolorosa de Moldes 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Dolorosa de Moldes 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Dolorosa de Moldes 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>3 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), na emblem\u00e1tica freguesia de <strong>Moldes<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Arouca<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. Integrando como 2\u00aa etapa oficial o prestigiado <strong>5\u00ba Circuito Terras do Mundo &#8211; Serra da Freita<\/strong>, o evento \u00e9 promovido pela <strong>Confraria Trotamontes<\/strong> em estreita parceria com o Munic\u00edpio de Arouca e a Junta de Freguesia de Moldes.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Podes desafiar os teus limites no exigente <strong>Trail de 16 km<\/strong> com cerca de <strong>1000m de desn\u00edvel positivo acumulado (+1000m D+)<\/strong>, com partida \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> no <strong>Centro Cultural e Recreativo de Moldes<\/strong>, ou desfrutar das paisagens c\u00e9nicas e do patrim\u00f3nio natural arouquense na <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s <strong>09:45<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza abastecimentos completos ao longo do percurso, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, medalha finisher a todos os atletas que cortem a linha de meta e balne\u00e1rios com duches no final nas Piscinas Municipais de Arouca.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; fo